WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:06.800
When we were outside the city thank you, miss when grandfather immediately knelt.

00:07.080 --> 00:08.600
It really startled me.

00:09.840 --> 00:13.000
Your Highness have you been standing here long?

00:14.400 --> 00:17.560
The melody is beautiful can you play another?

00:17.640 --> 00:19.040
Mm.

01:10.400 --> 01:13.467
This melody is warmer than the last.

01:15.960 --> 01:21.520
The previous one was for the departed this one is for Your Highness.

01:21.920 --> 01:25.280
Even someone made of iron needs to rest sometimes.

01:26.560 --> 01:29.840
After hearing your two melodies I feel much better.

01:33.040 --> 01:38.760
I see you, miss don't know martial arts why follow the volunteers to a dangerous place like Yiyang?

01:39.520 --> 01:44.320
Grandfather is my only family if I don't follow him where else can I go?

